# The engine shell on Kamidori's clean install (Kamidori/), whose AGERC.DLL is packed: the port's 終了 and options
# panel come from the shell, native's from AGERC (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-09-engine-shell-design.md, §8).
# 終了 over the title cancels; on the prologue page `option` steps set a ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ, a ｻｳﾝﾄﾞ and an その他 option, then
# 終了's タイトルに戻る resets the scene and SYSTEM4 reloads back to TITLE. Compare SYS4REG.INI after `close` on both
# targets: MessageSpeed=30, MusicFadeOnVoicePlayingVolume=20, EffectSkipOnClick=1. On a fresh sandbox, on both
# targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --profile kamidori port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --profile kamidori port run tools/drive/scenarios/kamidori-shell.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 4
close-request                           # 終了 over the title
wait 1
dialogs
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ
wait 1
expect script=TITLE

click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=30
wait 3
click newgame.begin
wait-state script=SC0000 timeout=60
wait-state at=SC0000@0xfa2 click=adv.next every=2.5 timeout=180   # １８年前、叛乱によって王政が崩壊すると、…
wait 3
options                                 # the sandbox's values
option message-speed 30
option lower-bgm-level 20
option effect-skip on
wait 1
options                                 # the values set above
expect at=SC0000@0xfa2

close-request
wait 1
answer タイトルに戻る(&T)
answer OK
wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # SYSTEM4 reloads: logos, then the title
wait 2
state
